  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Land restitution and legal support from civil soc CCJ-URT</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Land restitution and legal support from civil soc CCJ-URT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Denna insats syftar till att st&#xe4;rka Enheten f&#xf6;r &#xe5;terb&#xf6;rdande av       illegalt f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;rvad markegendom och dess juridiska strategi och        representation av offren i dessa komplicerade fall. Insatsen &#xe4;r       baserat p&#xe5; ett samarbetsavtal mellan den Colombianska kommissionen    f&#xf6;r jurister och Enheten f&#xf6;r &#xe5;terb&#xf6;rdande av illegalt f&#xf6;rv&#xe4;rvad       markegendom.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This contribution aims at strengthening the Unit for land             Restitution&apos;s litigation strategy and legal representation for        victims in complex cases of land restitution in Colombia. This        contribution is based on the association agreement between the        Comision Colombiana de Juristas and the Unit for land restitution.</narrative>
  </description>
